OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe Road Crimes Team pursue a 4x4
OL,7,     Fconnected to fuel theft,
OL,8,     Finterceptors battle to stop a
OL,9,     Fdangerous driver a stolen lorry,
OL,10,     Fand firearms cops are forced to
OL,11,     Fuse their big red key.
OL,12,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FA van driver blocks himself into a
OL,14,     Fdead end and repeatedly rams the
OL,15,     Finterceptors' car, while elsewhere
OL,16,     Fa self-confident drink driver gets
OL,17,     Fargumentative.
