OL,5,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FJim and Lisa direct an
OL,7,     Fintelligence-led strike. Suspects
OL,8,     Fare on the move; it's believed
OL,9,     Fthey're in possession of a handgun
OL,10,     Fand ammunition. The Knife Crime
OL,11,     FTeam target drug hotspots.
OL,12,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,13,     FIn Chelsea, a female shoplifter is
OL,14,     Fcompliant at first, but then she
OL,15,     Ftries to do a runner. And meet the
OL,16,     Fformer shoplifter who now works
OL,17,     Fwith shopkeepers to prevent their
OL,18,     Flosses. (Ep6)
OL,19,G1800 Home and Away
OL,20,     FJohn feels the pressure. Abigail
OL,21,     Fgets an ultimatum. Beau turns on
OL,22,     Fthe charm.
