OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FSonny's problems snowball.
OL,7,     FAbigail's grudge backfires. Beau
OL,8,     Fflexes his grip on Sonny.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FMohammed is back about his swollen
OL,11,     Fleg, which is getting more painful
OL,12,     Fand now makes walking difficult.
OL,13,     FOther cases include a worrying
OL,14,     Farmpit lump, and long-term
OL,15,     Fdepression and anxiety.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FA man named Terry, who fell off a
OL,18,     Froof and is seriously injured,
OL,19,     Fneeds help. A man named Jeff is
OL,20,     Fbrought in by ambulance after his
OL,21,     Fcar flipped onto its side.
