OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA pair of men who work at a
OL,7,     Fhazardous waste disposal business
OL,8,     Fare injured after an explosion
OL,9,     Frocks the premises; a street fight
OL,10,     Fends with two wounded.
OL,11,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FIn Rotherham's A&E a patient with
OL,13,     Fa suspected head injury is under
OL,14,     Farrest in the car park. In London,
OL,15,     Fan eye injury from mixing concrete
OL,16,     Frequires action to prevent
OL,17,     Fpermanent damage.
