OL,5,G0100 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, Barry worries the
OL,7,     Fcondition affecting his hands will
OL,8,     Fstop him doing the activities he
OL,9,     Floves, and Dr Abdul-Razaak lends
OL,10,     Fan ear to David who is suffering
OL,11,     Ffrom depression.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FA trainee nurse assesses a
OL,14,     F49-year-old man rushed in by
OL,15,     Fambulance. A 58-year-old woman has
OL,16,     Fa life-threatening allergic
OL,17,     Freaction to nuts. An 86-year-old
OL,18,     Fman has an arm injury.
